SUMMARY:Millersville National Night Out
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Millersville National Night Out! Church of the Apostles will be there sharing our message of welcome and connecting with our neighbors. Stop by our table\, say hello\, and enjoy an evening of community\, conversation\, and fun. We can’t wait to see you there!
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/millersville-national-night-out/
LOCATION:Millersville Borough Police Department\, 100 Municipal Dr\, Millersville\, PA\, 17551\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Millersville-National-Night-Out-2026.jpg
END:VEVENT
